{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In\u00a0<i>Fish Shop Simulator</i>\u00a0you manage your own aquatic store in a cozy New York neighborhood. Build your dream aquarium business by carefully selecting fish, aquariums, and decorations to create beautiful underwater environments for your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run your own aquarium shop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Serve a variety of customers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298720/extras/frag4.gif?t=1740884920\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design and sell custom aquariums</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298720/extras/frag2.gif?t=1740884920\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new items, aquariums, and rare fish as you grow your shop and attract more customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298720/extras/frag3.gif?t=1740884920\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep track of supplies, and shop decorations to maintain a thriving business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298720/extras/frag1.gif?t=1740884920\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy a blend of casual management and creative design as you shape your store into an underwater paradise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3298720?t=1740884920","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3298720?t=1740884920","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s